+    <string name="disc_nao_titulo">What the app does not do</string>
+    <string name="disc_nao_corpo">• Does not collect, store or share personal data.\n• Sends nothing to the internet: the app does not request network permission, so it has no way to transmit anything.\n• Shows no ads and uses no analytics tools.\n• Your settings (points, intervals and colors) stay on this device only and are deleted when you uninstall.</string>
 
